    },
    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Six areas of the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) - Nursing Services Division, Clinical Laboratories, Pharmacy, Neurophysiology, Purchase and Bio-Medical Engineering - have met the requirements of the ISO 9002 Quality System. The two-day audit was carried out in February 1999 by a team of five auditors from AIB Vincotte of Belgium. The auditors were impressed with AKUH's systems in these areas as well as the general level of compliance with all the written policies and procedures.",
